{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01269",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.35,
      "end_seconds": 4.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.59,
      "end_seconds": 10.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.52,
      "end_seconds": 20.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a stiff painful shoulder. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.82,
      "end_seconds": 25.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.63,
      "end_seconds": 30.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Glycomet. I take it twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.81,
      "end_seconds": 36.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.27,
      "end_seconds": 44.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "It's 500 milligrams. I take sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.28,
      "end_seconds": 48.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Right, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.66,
      "end_seconds": 52.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "For three weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.15,
      "end_seconds": 63.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.93,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.04,
      "end_seconds": 80.47,
      "duration_seconds": 13.43,
      "text": "It, It settles a little with rest. Honestly, once or twice a day. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. Reaching definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.85,
      "end_seconds": 84.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.35,
      "end_seconds": 110.79,
      "duration_seconds": 24.44,
      "text": "Being woken at night by the pain goes along with it, most of the time. Well, as for being woken at night by the pain, mostly moderate. I notice it more with lying on it. Uh, I've also had not being able to lift my arm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.74,
      "end_seconds": 116.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Have you had any fall, neck pain or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.43,
      "end_seconds": 121.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "No, no fall, neck pain or numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.64,
      "end_seconds": 125.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Okay, neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.16,
      "end_seconds": 132.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.96,
      "end_seconds": 152.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.41,
      "end_seconds": 157.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.95,
      "end_seconds": 159.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.21,
      "end_seconds": 165.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.02,
      "end_seconds": 168.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.37,
      "end_seconds": 174.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.29,
      "end_seconds": 178.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.58,
      "end_seconds": 184.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.65,
      "end_seconds": 187.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.83,
      "end_seconds": 191.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "I have diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.51,
      "end_seconds": 193.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.14,
      "end_seconds": 199.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I've had migraines, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.65,
      "end_seconds": 204.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Alright, migraines, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.17,
      "end_seconds": 221.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.11,
      "end_seconds": 232.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.23,
      "end_seconds": 253.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 74, temperature 36.7, BP is 128 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.27,
      "end_seconds": 257.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Mm, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.88,
      "end_seconds": 282.55,
      "duration_seconds": 23.67,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second. From what you've told me, my working impression is adhesive capsulitis, a frozen shoulder. A rotator cuff problem is also on my list. Just to be sure I understood. You've had a stiff painful shoulder for three weeks, mild, and no neck pain or fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.89,
      "end_seconds": 285.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.08,
      "end_seconds": 309.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "I'll request an X-ray of the shoulder, it'll help with shoulder pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 311.45,
      "end_seconds": 314.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "The earliest is Wednesday, 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.31,
      "end_seconds": 318.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Wednesday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.53,
      "end_seconds": 331.94,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "Gentle daily stretches within comfort, and heat before them. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.41,
      "end_seconds": 335.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "That's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.26,
      "end_seconds": 338.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Come back in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.01,
      "end_seconds": 342.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.8,
      "end_seconds": 348.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.49,
      "end_seconds": 354.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "So, I come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.74,
      "end_seconds": 359.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.01,
      "end_seconds": 364.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}